      },
      walkthrough = "**Status: Incomplete**\n\nQuest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Lceanium [zone=1086]\n**Who:**\n- Indagatrix Salus Acilia [ _Quests_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 95\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Quest\n**Related Zones:**\n- Scorched Woods [zone=1087]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a harried page [npc=51146]\n- an aggressive drake [npc=51595]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Partisan of Lceanium [quest=8274]\n**Era:** | !Empires of Kunark\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Fri Oct 14 20:48:36 2016\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **Speak to Indagatrix Salus Acilia in Lceanium up near the Scorched Woods zoneline tunnel.**\nYou say, 'Hail, Indagatrix Salus Acilia'\nIndagatrix Salus Acilia says 'Greetings Gidono. I've heard good things about you. If you are up to it, I have a [task:What task?] for you. The task may involve some [risk:I thrive on risk!].'\nYou say, 'What task?'\nIndagatrix Salus Acilia says 'Great, Gidono. I noted the task in your journal. As mentioned, this task does involve some [risk:I still enjoy risk.] that I would be happy to explain.'\nYou say, 'I still enjoy risk.'\nIndagatrix Salus Acilia says 'When we first came here, the great dragon [Gorenaire:Tell me more about Gorenaire] menaced the city. While she did not outright attack the city or any of it's inhabitants, she did sit atop a mount and [watch:She just watched?]'\nYou say, 'Tell me more about Gorenaire'\nIndagatrix Salus Acilia says 'She is a magnificent white dragon. I have never seen anything as terrifyingly beautiful.'\nYou say, 'She just watched?'\nIndagatrix Salus Acilia says 'She didn't just watch us. She would also [fly] over us.'\nYou say, 'fly'\nIndagatrix Salus Acilia has a far away worshipful look in her eyes. 'She [was:What do you mean was?] simply majestic. She wouldn't just fly high above, she would glide regally through the great spires and let her tail brush the smaller spires.'\nYou say, 'What do you mean was?'\nIndagatrix Salus Acilia says 'Well. A while ago she simply disappeared. She's no longer watching us, nor is she in the dreadlands nor with the other dragons. She [vanished:A dragon vanished?].'\nYou say, 'A dragon vanished?'\nIndagatrix Salus Acilia says 'Yes. And that is your task. Use whatever means you can to find her. Start your search near the entrance to the yeti caves. From there see where the path leads you. Be warned that you may need to kill some of the beings in the area to find what has become '\nYou have been assigned the task 'Disappearing Dragons'.\n\n---\n\n1\\. See if you can find any traces of Gorenaire near the yeti cave\nIn front of the Yeti cave in the southeast part of the zone, stand at location: -965, -1502, 56 and you will receive yellow text stating \"You continue to carefully search the area.\". Stand there for a minute until the task updates.\n2\\. See if you can find any traces of Gorenaire near the druid ring\nStand at the southern end of the druid ring at location 908, -414, -36\n3\\. See if you can find any traces of Gorenaire near the wizard spire\nStand in the middle of the wizard spire at location 1348, 1444, -56 in the northwestern part of the zone until the task updates.\n4\\. Follow the trail\nA trail should appear however it didn't for me, but a red X appeared on the map. Before you get there be prepared to kill a drake for each member of the group who has the task, one will spawn at a time. You will need to go back over the spot to retrigger the other drakes for the other group members. They will attack you as soon as you reach the spot at the island in the middle of the lake.\nThe aggressive drakes are triggered by standing at the highest point on the peninsula. One spawns for each player at this stage of the quest standing on this spot.\nThe drakes are rootable but not mezable or stunable.\n5\\. Defend yourself and kill the Drakes coming after you 0/4\nKill all 4 of an aggressive drake. It's best to send in just one person to grab these drakes and drag them back to a camp.\n6\\. Follow the trail\nLook at your map, it should show another red X that is back in the city on the east ramp.\n7\\. Ask the guard if they have seen anything [unusual]\nWhen going up the ramp, the guard on the right, say unusual to this guard and then go through the rest of the dialog.\n8\\. Follow the trail\nOn your map again should be a red X inside the main temple in the center of the city.\n9\\. Ask the golem if it has seen anyone out of [place]\nTarget the golem and say place and follow the dialog.\n10\\. Follow the trail\nAnother red X appears on your map at the harried page.\n11\\. Ask the page if it has seen anyone [suspicious]\nTarget the harried page and say suspicious. Follow the dialog.\n12\\. Follow the trail\nA red X appears on your map again to the south of the city at the entrance of the Drachnid tunnels.\n13\\. Kill Drachnid to look for clues 0/10\nKill 10 Drachnids.\n14, Go into the Scorched Woods\nScorched Woods tunnel is in the northeast corner of Lceanium. This step will update in Scorched woods as you zone over from Lceanium. (Levitation appears to bug the update so it is advisable to drop it before zoning).\n15\\. Ask one of the salus soldiers if they have seen anyone [suspicious]\nTarget one of the salus soldiers at the entrance, one standing at the dirt path, close to the quest NPCs: Strategus Pommori and Domina Caelestis and say suspicious and then go through their dialog.\n16\\. Follow the trail\nAnother red X appears on your map up in the northeast section of the zone, go to it.\n17\\. Kill sarnak to look for clues 0/10\nKill 10 Sarnak's up in the northeast section of the zone towards Chardok.\n18\\. Share your (conclusions) with Indagatrix Salus Acilia\nCome back to Lceanium and talk to Indagatrix Salus Acilia. Say conclusions and follow the dialog.\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\n319pp\nExperience\n**Need detailed information such as dialog for each step on this quest.**\n- 319pp, Experience",
