      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Lceanium [zone=1086]\n**Who:**\n- a harried page [npc=51146]\nRating:\n0/2**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\n(Average from 2 ratings)\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 95\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Quest Items:**\n- Combine Robe Disguise [item=127359]\n- Drachnid Bile [item=126771]\n- Drachnid Repellant Glop [item=127354]\n- Drachnid Repellant Jar [item=127355]\n- Dreadland Orange [item=127313]\n- Soap Leaves [item=127314]\n- Tsaph Katta's Note [item=127360]\n- Yeti Tick [item=127308]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Salli Westell [ _General Supplies_]\n- Tsaph Katta [npc=51140]\n- a Sarnak portalkeeper [npc=50940]\n- a frenzied drachnid silkmistress [npc=51144]\n- a harried page [npc=51146]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Component Supplies [quest=8390]\n- Concerned Citizens [quest=8272]\n- Meat Supplies [quest=8387]\n- Metal Supplies [quest=8391]\n- Momentum Supplies [quest=8384]\n- Partisan of Lceanium [quest=8274]\n- Repurposed Supplies [quest=8388]\n- Vegetable Supplies [quest=8386]\n- Water Supplies [quest=8383]\n**Era:** | !Empires of Kunark\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Sat Nov 19 19:24:34 2016\nModified: Thu Oct 31 02:13:35 2024 | | Pre req: Complete the task Concerned Citizens [quest=8272] and you will automatically be given this task.\nYou have been assigned the task 'Contacting the Leadership'\n\n---\n\n1\\. Speak with Salli Westell about the [page] 0/1 Lceanium\nSalli Westell [npc=51127] is one of the merchants on the north side of the city.\nYou say, 'page'\nSalli Westell says 'I was afraid something like this was happening. But before I explain, we are in need of more [supplies:I can help with supplies] and some [special assistance:What special assistance do you need?].'\nYou say, 'I can help with supplies'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Vegetable Supplies'.\nYour task 'Contacting the Leadership' has been updated.\nSalli Westell says 'Talk to the other merchants and see if they need anything. I need you to retrieve this for me.'\nYou say, 'What special assistance do you need?'\nSalli Westell says 'Come back after you help retrieve all of the supplies.'\n2\\. Gather [supplies] for each merchant. They will give you a task if you speak to them 0/7 Lceanium\nSay **supplies** to all the surrounding merchants in the square. All 7 will give you a supplies quest :\n\\- Component Supplies [quest=8390] : collect 4 Dreadland Bone Dust [item=127345]\n\\- Meat Supplies [quest=8387] : collect 3 Raw Wild Meat [item=127348]\n\\- Metal Supplies [quest=8391] : collect 5 Dreadland Ore [item=127343]\n\\- Momentum Supplies [quest=8384] : collect 7 Yeti Toenails [item=127470]\n\\- Repurposed Supplies [quest=8388] : collect 3 Mountain Ale [item=127509]\n\\- Vegetable Supplies [quest=8386] : collect 5 Dreadland Vegetables [item=127309]\n\\- Water Supplies [quest=8383]. : collect 5 Dreadland Water [item=127356]\n3.Speak with Salli Westell since you have [completed] all of the supply runs 0/1 Lceanium\nSay **completed** and **gorenaire** to her.\n4\\. Speak with Salli Westell about the [drachnid] 0/1 Lceanium\nSay **drachnid** to her and go through her dialogue.\n5\\. Explore the tunnels to the rest of the Dreadlands 0/1 Lceanium\nYou will get this update in the south eastern part of the yeti cave.\n6\\. Kill the Sarnak Portal Keepers 0/2 Lceanium\nThe Sarnak Portal Keepers [npc=50940] are located in the Yeti cave to the east of the city. They will spawn once you reach the trigger location (the door on your map). They are both snareable, rootable and see invis and will auto aggro you.\nIf you need to redo this part of the quest, say **sealed** to Salli Westell.\n7\\. Create the Drachnid Repellant 0/1 Lceanium\nMake Drachnid Repellant Glop [item=127354] first and then make the Drachnid Repellent Jar [item=127355].\nDrachnid Repellant Glop recipe\nDrachnid Repellent Jar recipe\n8\\. Find a good spot in the mines to deploy the repellant 0/1 Lceanium\nTo the south of the city is the drachnid tunnels. In the furthest south room of the tunnels, the big room. Clear this room completely first and into the two tunnels leading north and into those two small rooms. If you can find a safe spot near the big room then right click the Drachnid Repellant Jar [item=127355] near the edge of the big room. 2 frenzied drachnids will spawn and attack. Pull them back to your safe spot and kill.\n9\\. Kill the frenzied drachnids 0/2 Lceanium\nIf you wipe to this part, say **again** to Salli Westell.\n10\\. Speak with Salli Westell once you are [done] 0/1 Lceanium\nSay **done** to her.\n11\\. Speak with Tsaph Katta about the citizens' [problems] 0/1 Lceanium\nSay **worried** to Tsaph Katta [npc=51140].\n12\\. Speak with Salli Westell about being [ejected] 0/1 Lceanium>\nSay **ejected** to her.\n13\\. Speak with Tsaph Katta about the citizens' [problems] 0/1 Lceanium\nSay **worried** to Tsaph. If this part fails, make sure you have the robe [item=127359] with you that was given to you earlier in the quest. If you don't have it, say **disguise** to Salli Westell to get another.\n14\\. Deliver 1 Tsaph Katta's Note to the harried page 0/1 Lceanium\n15\\. Deliver 1 Combine Robe Disguise to Salli Westell 0/1 Lceanium\nReward(s):\n425 platinum 5 gold\nYou gain experience!\n**Need detailed information for each step.**\n**Submitted by:** Gidono\n- 425pp 5gp, Experience",
