      },
      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Lceanium [zone=1086]\n**Who:**\n- Praetor Vixelo [ _Quests_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Time:** | 360\n**Level:** | 95\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Loot\n- Money\n**Success Lockout Timer**: 01:00:00\n**Quest Items:**\n- Chardok Battle Plans [item=127490]\n- Chardok Logistics Report [item=127489]\n**Related Zones:**\n- Chardok [EoK]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Ralla Merow`shu [ _Quests_]\n- a frustrated fisherman [ _Quests_]\n**Era:** | !Empires of Kunark\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Group\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 6\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Sun Nov 20 09:55:39 2016\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | Prerequisite Quests: Partisan of Lceanium [quest=8274] and Partisan of the Scorched Woods [quest=8348] achievements.\nThis is a shared task. Say **extract** to Praetor Vixelo in Lceanium to trigger the task. He's located in the NW room of the main building.\n\n---\n\n1\\. Travel to Chardok 0/1 (Chardok)\nYou've been recruited by Combine Leadership to aid their operative inside Chardok. Specifically, you're tasked with identifying ways to weaken the city's infrastructure and supply lines before Combine forces engage.\n2\\. Find Prince Selrach Di`zok's room 0/1 (Chardok)\nThe longstanding Prince of Chardok, Selrach Di`zok, should be heavily involved in organizing the city's defenses. Find the prince's quarters in the Royal Palace. Combine agents report his room is located in the Western section.\nThis is at -350, 234, -269 (most westernly room of the zone)\n3\\. Collect intel from Sarnak near the Prince's room 0/1 (Chardok)\nYou've located the Prince's room. Kill nearby Sarnak until you recover some form of actionable intel, hopefully about the logistics or supplies of their military.\nDi'Zok royal guard dropped Chardok Logistics Report.\n4\\. Search Queen Velazul Di`zok's room 0/1 (Chardok)\nIt won't be easy to find Queen Velazul Di`zok's quarters, but it's worth the risk. You will no doubt be able to acquire invaluable intelligence there. Combine agents believe the Queen's room to be hidden in the Southern side and on the lowest levels of the Royal Palace.\nThis is at -1070, -270, -381.\n5\\. Collect intel from Sarnak near the Queen's room 0/1 (Chardok)\nYou've located the Queen's chambers. Thankfully she's not there right now. Kill nearby Sarnak until you find some details of their military plans that the Combine can exploit.\nDi'zok Warlord in the same room dropped Chardok Battle Plans.\n6\\. Travel to the rendevous point 0/1 (Chardok)\nPraetor Vixelo instructed you to report your findings to one of the Combine agents working in Chardok. You're supposed to rendezvous with your contact in the Night Garden, the central underground garden of Chardok, located below the bridges in front of the Royal Palace. Your contact should be on the Southern shore of the river.\nYour contact is a frustrated fisherman.\n7\\. Say the secret phrase to your contact 0/1 (Chardok)\nYou've reached the rendezvous location but only see Sarnak. Your contact must be undercover. Vixelo's instructions tell you to speak the code phrase 'deep aegis' to identify yourself to the agent.\nThe agent is a frustrated fisherman.\n8\\. Give the Logistics Document to Ralla 0/1 (Chardok)\n9\\. Give the Troop Movements document to Ralla 0/1 (Chardok)\nGive the Chardok Logistics Report to Ralla Merow'shu.\nGive the Chardok Battle Plans to Ralla Merow'shu.\n10\\. Talk with Ralla about what's next 0/1 (Chardok)\nSay \"Agreed. It's an honor to work with you, Agent Ralla.\" to Ralla Merow'shu to receive your next mission.\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\n425 platinum 5 gold\nYou gain experience!!\nRalla's Recall Gem\n- Ralla's Recall Gem [item=127484]",
