      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Lceanium [zone=1086]\n**Who:**\n- Praetor Denik [ _Mission and Raid_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Time:** | 360\n**Level:** | 95\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Success Lockout Timer**: 06:00:00\n**Quest Items:**\n- Emblem of the Combine [item=126564]\n**Related Zones:**\n- Lceanium: Before the Siege [zone=1094]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Warleader Kaslinot [npc=51637]\n- a Sarnak dragoon [npc=51708]\n- a hunter [npc=51638]\n- a reward chest - Lceanium: Before the Siege [npc=51635]\n- a soldier [npc=51636]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Hero of Lceanium [quest=8275]\n**Era:** | !Empires of Kunark\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Group\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 6\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Mon Nov 21 19:14:31 2016\nModified: Sat Jun 14 15:19:01 2025 | | There is a 1 hour lockout between different missions.\nThis is a group mission. Say **mission** to Praetor Denik in Lceanium to trigger the mission. He's located to the east of the main building.\nThe player requesting the task must have completed the Partisan of Lceanium [quest=8274] achievement.\nSay **ready** to zone into the instanced version of Lceanium.\nNPC's can be buffed.\nTalk to Tsaph about what he needs from you 0/1\nSpeak with Tsaph. He has need of you right now.\nFind the cause of the quiet in the hills outside the city 0/1\nAll of the beasts and giants in the hills outside of the city have gone into hiding. There must be a reason for this, and Tsaph would like you to find out what that reason is.\nRun up to the sarnak leader Warleader Kaslinot at the northeast cave entrance for an update\n**TASK LOCKS HERE**\nTell Tsaph Katta what you have heard and seen 0/1\nTell Tsaph about the warleaders and his guards.\nKill the Sarnak leader 0/1\nThere is nothing else to be done, that Sarnak leader needs to be killed.\nKill Warleader Kaslinot. Warleader can be tanked in his corner. He has like 3,5 million hitpoints and max hit was 23 k. Warleader casts Tendon Cut (snare), Bladed Fury, a 43 K AE, Stunning Strike, single knockback, and Sarnak Finesse (increased chance to riposte).\nSpeak with Tsaph Katta about your success 0/1\nTell Tsaph that you defeated the Sarnak leader.\nDefend Tsaph 0/4\nAssassins have come to kill Tsaph Katta! Defend him!\nThe mobs on this step are immune to mez and changes in runspeed. You can buff Tsaph before he's attacked.\nKill the 4 \"a hunter\".\nDefend the eastern breach until the barrier can be built 0/6\nSarnak troops have begun moving on the city. They appear to be heading toward the eastern breach in the wall. You will be needed to defend that breach while the Combine magic users set up defenses.\nThe mobs on this step are immune to mez and changes in runspeed.\nDefend the northern breaches until the barrier can be built 0/6\nSarnak troops have begun moving on the city. They appear to be heading toward the northern breach now. Defend that breach while the Combine magic users set up defenses.\nThe mobs on this step are immune to mez and changes in runspeed.\nSpeak with Tsaph 0/1\nSpeak with Tsaph now that there is a break in the fighting. Tsaph has rewarded you for your help. The next step will be preparing forces for what may be an all out war.\nOpen the chest 0/1\nOpen \"a reward chest\" to get your rewards!\nReward(s):\n425 platinum 5 gold\nYou gain experience!!\nAchievement: Hero of Lceanium\n- Amorphous Cohort's Breastplate [item=127358]\n- Amorphous Cohort's Helm [item=127491]\n- Amorphous Cohort's Leggings [item=127522]\n- Amorphous Cohort's Sleeves [item=127616]",
